{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:11d76f8fd128c198","name":"Brintak","source":{"id":"source:reference-11d76f8fd128c198","title":"Brintak","revision":23527,"timestamp":"2024-09-29T21:16:56Z","sha256":"bbfb166082b3c17f6a174f85c2a250d6ec86be4494030bf264a9f07f56f55eba","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23527","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Brintak&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-11d76f8fd128c198","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["From somewhere above you in one of the great toroc trees, you hear the low rumble of a large and hostile creature. As the rumble builds to a disturbing roar, a massive, four-legged beast with mottled black skin leaps down from a huge bronch. The vicious creature gnashes at you with rows of razorlike teeth. Its jaws are flanked by a pair of slender tentacles that lash out toward you, eager to pull you into the gaping mouth."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Brintak is a massive, muscular, four-legged beast that towers over most humanoids. Its large, elongated head features multiple rows of razor-sharp teeth. Its mouth is flanked on each side by barb-tipped, tentaclelike appendages that ensnare and poison a victim while drawing prey into the creature's mouth. Brintaks live in many of the groves of enormous toroc trees on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Giaca"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Giaca","referenceId":"reference:ce8baa140a5a7043"},". They find food in the groves and the surrounding landscape. The largest Brintaks are solitary hunters, but younger and smaller Brintaks hunt in packs of four to six. Brintaks are social creatures and live in dens of hollowed-out toroc trees, often high above the ground. Packs number up to 20 members.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Brintak Statistics (CL 14)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," 15\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +8; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +12\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 25 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 23), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 18, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 10; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dodge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dodge","referenceId":"reference:9444f216899dc20b"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mobility"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mobility","referenceId":"reference:e8f000eec8570e3b"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 188, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 28\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," 6 Squares; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Charge","referenceId":"r