heze.org/wiki/Jump","referenceId":"reference:9ee0ca3e24d60ea0"}," DC when doing so. If the Brintak successfully jumps into or adjacent to a target enemy's square, the Brintak can make an immediate attack against the target. If the attack is successful, the Brintak can attempt to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trip"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trip","referenceId":"reference:bd13d5a0906be48e"}," the target as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," that does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Roar:"]}," As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", a Brintak can produce a terrifying, rumbling roar and make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"}," any enemy target within 6 squares. If the check succeeds, the target must move away from the Brintak at its normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," on the target's next turn, and the target moves -1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["-1 Condition"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," 15\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},"